    "reason": "Technical current-context binding of the exact unchanged whole363 coordinate-model profile after the accepted direct-prior and own-scope successor. Concrete independently informed current-context evidence: /mnt/e/skillpilot-chemie-L7-20261017/two-BW-and-coordinate-priors-current-P9-context-author-root-v2/REVIEW-INPUT.clean-same-two-components-with-current-P9-contexts.json @ sha256:5f25f437528cf88525d2385f183edabbc1eb7608a8312fc5936e06171a622561; /mnt/e/skillpilot-chemie-L7-20261017/two-BW-and-coordinate-priors-current-P9-context-independent-a-v2/FOLLOWUP.independent-a.current-P9-context.json @ sha256:be32cb82b44af227608e61d4ec12255127df3aafd0b967573c212402d09c76e5; /mnt/e/skillpilot-chemie-L7-20261017/two-BW-and-coordinate-priors-current-P9-context-independent-b-v2/FOLLOWUP.review.json @ sha256:e562434202f051e6d8adaf994394744ed4cda0b5ff764d81ee6992d5cc367e44. Original v1 FIRSTs and root receipts remain archived as history. These are bounded informed followups, not32 new votes or whole9b/95dc reapproval. Current P9 profiles remain exact; original reviewId and own criteria namespace are retained. Actual stock fingerprints use this physical private capsule and its actual resource bytes. E1/G1 AI candidate, no new scientific opinion, observed learner work, formal run ID, Human Approval or M7 claim. Existing149 frontend exclusions and final Native/Central acceptance remain open.",
